# Data Notes & Metric Definitions

## Dataset scope

- Fictional outpatient healthcare network.
- Synthetic data; no real patients or provider organization.
- 8 clinics and 5 departments.
- Approximately 2,200 synthetic patient records and 7,200 appointment records.
- Observed period: approximately September 2025–August 2026.

## Tables in the source workbook

| Table | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Clinics | Clinic reference information |
| Departments | Department reference information |
| Providers | Provider reference information |
| Patients | Synthetic patient records |
| Appointments | Appointment-level activity and outcomes |
